{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51020","headline":"七日禁中陪宴 · 仁贞","name":"七日禁中陪宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入朝贵国慙下客，七日承恩作上宾。\n更见鳯（一作「凰」）声无妓态，风流变动一园（一作「国」）春。\n（此诗爲仁贞在日本国作。\n见金毓黻撰《渤海国志长编》卷十八引《文华秀丽集》上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"仁贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}